[agent] I produced the feature table **`scored342daf` v1** on the Hopsworks platform with exactly the required columns and online+offline availability.
[agent] **What I did (all compute platform-side):**
[agent] 1. **Ingested raw inputs** into two source feature groups (pure CSV load, no local computation):
[agent]    - `requests_src` v1 — `request_id` (PK), `account_id`, `request_lat`, `request_lon` (400 rows)
[agent]    - `profiles_src` v1 — `account_id` (PK), `home_lat`, `home_lon`, `base_score` (60 rows)
[agent] 2. **Computed the on-demand transformation on the platform** via Trino SQL against the offline store (Delta catalog): joined each request to its stored profile on `account_id`, then computed
